  "description": "Specialized generic collections for .NET 8: circular buffer, deque, evicting dictionary, sequenced dictionary, indexed and ordered sets, indexed priority queue, multi-value dictionary, multiset, range set and range dictionary, segmented buffer, graphs (adjacency-list graph, traversal and shortest-path algorithms, disjoint set), and trees (n-ary tree, tries). Also ships the approximate sketches in Bodu.Collections.Probabilistic and the packed BitSet in Bodu.Collections.Specialized. Every collection ships a struct enumerator for allocation-free iteration and implements the standard BCL collection interfaces. Thread-safe variants live in Bodu.Collections.Concurrent.",
